{const c={"id":"transport-leak-v22","sceneId":"t1","title":"管道泄漏智能检测：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"入口与出口流量差可能来自管道库存变化、计量误差或泄漏。监测要结合正常工况，不能把任意不平衡直接当作泄漏。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"正常回归基线 + 残差检测","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"残差报警与误报漏报","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"管道泄漏智能检测专业概念\"><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\"><path d=\"M20 45H310M20 115H310\" stroke=\"#7c9b8b\" stroke-width=\"7\"/><path d=\"M45 80H260M170 80V140\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"55\">进出流量差还包含管存变化</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"100\">先校正正常工况，再查未解释残差</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"140\">报警不是泄漏确诊或位置</text></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"运输概念示意\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><path d=\"M25 60H230M25 110H230\" stroke=\"#77978a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M60 85H190\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"65\">流动 / 壁厚 / 能耗 → 数据与机理</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"115\">先核对工况、计量与模型假设</text></g></svg><p>入口与出口流量差可能来自管道库存变化、计量误差或泄漏。监测要结合正常工况，不能把任意不平衡直接当作泄漏。</p><p>概念示意，非实际管网、仪表或储罐工程图。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：进出流差、压力变化与管存代理。方法：正常回归基线 + 残差检测。输出：残差报警与误报漏报。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐时钟与流量单位</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习正常工况关系</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>按残差尺度检测</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较固定流差阈值</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>正常工况学习 → 管存代理校正 → 残差 → 复核。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>现场需 进出流差、压力变化与管存代理，保留校准、检测或运行来源并统一时钟、单位和参考条件；按独立管段、设备、标定批次或时间块留出验证。</p><p>全部为教学合成数据，代理和正常基线用 400 个独立样本学习；测试种子初始 91，训练种子 17。真实测试标签不进入预测。换井切换独立测量或已知分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不重新训练。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-production/midstream/pipeline-integrity/pipeline-integrity-monitoring-and-leak-detection\">SLB：管道完整性与泄漏监测</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/delivering-digital-at-scale/software/olga/olga-pipeline-management/olga-pipeline-corrosion\">SLB：腐蚀环境影响因素</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归方法原理</a>。简化生成式与代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"管道泄漏智能检测：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 对齐时钟与流量单位","role":"数据","do":"进出流差、压力变化与管存代理统一时钟、单位与数据来源。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习正常工况关系","role":"学习","do":"正常回归基线 + 残差检测；隔离标定或正常训练数据。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 按残差尺度检测","role":"推理","do":"正常工况学习 → 管存代理校正 → 残差 → 复核；实时滑块改变教学条件。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较固定流差阈值","role":"验收","do":"与同条件基线对照并导出 CSV，明确 无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<p>正常工况学习 → 管存代理校正 → 残差 → 复核</p><p>检测用 F1、误报及漏报；回归用独立真值 MAE；优化比较同需求功率并检查容量与流量守恒；外推明确假设阈值。异常分数不是经现场校准的事故概率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2930,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>管道泄漏智能检测</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试工况 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>管道泄漏智能检测</h1><p class=\"lead\">入口与出口流量差可能来自管道库存变化、计量误差或泄漏。监测要结合正常工况，不能把任意不平衡直接当作泄漏。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一组样例 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>合成未解释流差（m³/h） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"合成未解释流差（m³/h）\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"4\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：真值/阈值；绿：模型/校正；蓝：基线或另一传感代理。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>观测流量差：含正常管存响应与未解释流差</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"观测流量差：含正常管存响应与未解释流差\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>正常回归校正后的残差分数及阈值</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"正常回归校正后的残差分数及阈值\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>正常回归基线 + 残差检测；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">无负压波定位和多相水力模型，报警不能直接确认泄漏。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13552,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"leak\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":4,\"inspect\":\"流量差m³/h，residual_z为扣除正常管存代理后的标准化残差。真值只做验收；零未解释流失时无合成事件，F1不作评价。残差异常不直接确诊泄漏。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),d=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),x,y;if(TYPE==='leak'){x=[1,a];y=.2+3*a+(r()-.5)*.5}else if(TYPE==='corrosion'){x=[1,a,b,a*b];y=.08+.25*a+.12*b+.08*a*b+(r()-.5)*.015}else if(TYPE==='pump'){let q1=a*90,q2=b*80;x=[1,q1,q2,q1*q1,q2*q2];y=2+.08*q1+.1*q2+.003*q1*q1+.004*q2*q2+(r()-.5)}else if(TYPE==='meter'){let actual=50+a*250,temp=b;let observed=actual*1.08+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*.5;x=[1,observed,temp];y=actual}else{x=[1,a];y=(r()-.5)*1.2}d.push({x,y})}let w=fit(d),res=d.map(v=>v.y-predict(w,v.x)),sd=Math.sqrt(res.reduce((s,v)=>s+v*v,0)/res.length);return {w,sd:Math.max(.2,sd)}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction counts(a,t){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&t[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(t[i])fn++});return {f:t.some(Boolean)?(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—（无事件）',fp,fn}}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,n=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=n.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='leak'){let raw=[],score=[],truth=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let change=.5+.4*Math.sin(i/13),event=i>=50&&i<90&&p>0,value=.2+3*change+(event?p:0)+(r()-.5)*n*4,residual=value-predict(model.w,[1,change]),z=residual/model.sd;raw.push(value);score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);alarm.push(z>3?1:0);base.push(value>2.5?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,truth);chart('a',[{values:raw,color:'#43836b'}],-2,15,'分钟采样序号','入口−出口流量差 / m³·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-10,...score)*1.1,Math.max(55,...score)*1.1,'分钟采样序号（事件窗口50–89，零流失时无事件）','扣除管存代理后的残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['学习残差 F1',c.f],['固定流差阈值 F1',counts(base,truth).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['学习正常尺度',model.sd.toFixed(3)+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常运行数据学习压力变化/管存代理与进出流差的关系，再对残差按正常尺度阈值检测。第一滑块为合成未解释流量，第二为传感噪声。异常流差也可能来自标定、时间不同步或模型误差，不能直接确认泄漏；未实现负压波定位或多相管存计算。';head=['minute','flow_imbalance_m3_h','residual_z','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,raw[i],score[i],v,alarm[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='corrosion'){let trueRate=[],rate=[],depth=[],remaining=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let env=i/99,wet=.6,actual=.08+.25*env+.12*wet+.08*env*wet,x=clamp(env+(r()-.5)*n,0,1),est=Math.max(.01,predict(model.w,[1,x,wet,x*wet])),d=1.2+env*.8,year=(p-d)/est;trueRate.push(actual);rate.push(est);depth.push(d);remaining.push(Math.max(0,year));base.push(.25)}chart('a',[{values:trueRate,color:'#c59048'},{values:rate,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,.6,'缺陷编号（0–99）','腐蚀增长率 / mm·年⁻¹（合成）');chart('b',[{values:remaining,color:'#43836b'}],0,Math.max(45,...remaining)*1.05,'缺陷编号','达到教学损失阈值的外推时间 / 年');let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-trueRate[i]),0)/100;metrics([['模型增长率 MAE',mae(rate).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['固定速率 MAE',mae(base).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['损失阈值假设',p+' mm'],['最短外推时间',Math.min(...remaining).toFixed(1)+' 年']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成环境与润湿条件样本训练增长率回归；用当前损失量与预测增长率线性外推到指定损失阈值。第一滑块是教学阈值，第二是环境观测误差。未进行两次内检测缺陷配准或真实剩余强度评定，外推时间不是合规寿命、破裂时间或维修期限。';head=['defect','current_loss_mm','true_rate_mm_y','predicted_rate_mm_y','time_to_assumed_limit_y'];rows=rate.map((v,i)=>[i,depth[i],trueRate[i],v,remaining[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='pump'){let all=[];for(let q1=0;q1<=90;q1++){let q2=p-q1;if(q2<0||q2>80)continue;let power=pumpPower(q1,q2)*(1+n*.2);all.push({q1,q2,power})}let best=all.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.power-b.power)[0],equal=p/2,base=equal<=80?pumpPower(equal,equal)*(1+n*.2):null;chart('a',[{values:all.map(v=>v.power),color:'#43836b'}],0,150,'可行分配序号（第一泵流量递增）','预测总功率 / kW（合成）');chart('b',[{values:[best.q1,best.q2],color:'#43836b'},{values:[equal,equal],color:'#648eae'}],0,100,'泵编号 0 / 1','绿最优 / 蓝均分流量 m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['最优功率',best.power.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['均分基线',base===null?'容量不兼容':base.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['推荐分配',best.q1+' / '+best.q2+' m³/h'],['需求约束',best.q1+best.q2+' / '+p]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成运行点拟合两泵流量与总功率二次代理，在总流量等于需求、单泵不超过 90/80 m³/h 条件下枚举整数分配并最小化预测功率。第二滑块统一增加阻力代价，换井增加已知的分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不变。仅为两泵分流，不是完整管网水力或压缩机优化；未校验扬程、汽蚀、最小流量或启停约束，零流量也保留模型常数项。';head=['pump0_m3_h','pump1_m3_h','predicted_power_kW','selected'];rows=all.map(v=>[v.q1,v.q2,v.power,v===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='meter'){let truth=[],raw=[],correct=[],temperature=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let actual=80+i*2,temp=.5+.3*Math.sin(i/12),reading=actual*(1.08+p/100)+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*n*10;truth.push(actual);raw.push(reading);correct.push(predict(model.w,[1,reading,temp]));temperature.push(temp)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100;chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:raw,color:'#648eae'},{values:correct,color:'#43836b'}],0,380,'独立测试点序号','流量 / m³·h⁻¹（统一参考条件）');chart('b',[{values:raw.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#648eae'},{values:correct.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#43836b'}],-20,100,'测试点序号','校正前后误差 / m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['校正 MAE',mae(correct).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['原始读数 MAE',mae(raw).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['学得读数系数',model.w[1].toFixed(4)],['测试新增增益漂移',p+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个独立参考标定点学习“读数+温度代理→参考流量”的线性校正。第一滑块只改变标定后的测试增益漂移，第二增加测试读数噪声；固定校正会在漂移增加时失准，不能无条件沿用。不是多相流率反演或标准温压换算，不自动修改真实仪表系数。橙参考、蓝原读数、绿校正。';head=['sample','reference_m3_h','raw_m3_h','corrected_m3_h','temperature_proxy'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,raw[i],correct[i],temperature[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='tank'){let level=4,truth=[],radar=[],vision=[],leaks=[],score=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<90&&p>0;level+=(2-(event?p:0))/60/50;truth.push(level);radar.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.01);vision.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.02);leaks.push(event?1:0)}for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let residual=i>=5?(radar[i-5]+2*5/60/50-radar[i])*50/(5/60):0,z=(residual-predict(model.w,[1,.5]))/model.sd;score.push(z);alarm.push(i>=5&&z>3?1:0);base.push(radar[i]<3.95?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,leaks);chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:radar,color:'#43836b'},{values:vision,color:'#648eae'}],3.7,4.2,'分钟序号（零流失时无事件）','橙真值 / 绿雷达 / 蓝视觉代理液位 m');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-15,...score)*1.1,Math.max(40,...score)*1.1,'分钟序号（5 分钟滑窗）','液位物料平衡残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['残差检测 F1',c.f],['低液位基线 F1',counts(base,leaks).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['合成未解释流失',p+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='假设罐截面积 50 m²、净入流 2 m³/h，以五分钟雷达液位变化核对物料平衡，正常残差尺度从 400 点学习。蓝色视觉读数只是独立数值传感代理，当前不参与报警，未实现视频读数/OCR。第一滑块为未知流失量，第二为液位测量噪声；残差异常也可能来自传感故障或流量计误差，不能直接确认泄漏。滑窗使事件边缘出现延迟与拖尾。';head=['minute','true_level_m','radar_level_m','visual_proxy_level_m','truth_event','residual_score','alarm','low_level_alarm'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,radar[i],vision[i],leaks[i],score[i],alarm[i],base[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='transport-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent='固定独立训练系数：'+JSON.stringify(model.w)+'；学习残差尺度 '+model.sd.toFixed(5)+(TYPE==='pump'?'；本井附加阻力修正等级 '+((seed-91)%11):'')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='leak'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='corrosion'?r[3]-r[2]:TYPE==='pump'?r[2]:TYPE==='meter'?r[3]-r[1]:+(r[4]!==r[6])),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='leak'||TYPE==='tank'?'逐分钟误报/漏报位置（高柱为判错）':TYPE==='corrosion'?'预测增长率−合成真值 / mm·年⁻¹':TYPE==='pump'?'满足同需求与容量约束的各候选功率 / kW':'校正后读数−参考值 / m³·h⁻¹';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(.5,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.5,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\nfunction pumpPower(a,b){return predict(model.w,[1,a,b,a*a,b*b])+((seed-91)%11)*(.00025*a*a+.00008*b*b)}\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].status="full";}
{const c={"id":"transport-corrosion-v22","sceneId":"t2","title":"管道腐蚀智能评估：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"内检测可以提供金属损失和缺陷尺寸等证据，环境和润湿状态可能影响增长。缺陷匹配误差与测量误差会影响跨期评估。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"腐蚀增长率回归 + 线性外推","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"增长率和到假设阈值的外推时间","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"管道腐蚀智能评估专业概念\"><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\"><path d=\"M25 35H310M25 130H310\" stroke=\"#7c9b8b\" stroke-width=\"12\"/><path d=\"M95 40Q140 90 190 40\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"8\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"55\">当前损失 + 增长率 → 假设阈值外推</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"100\">速率变动、测量与缺陷配准需复核</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"140\">外推时间不直接决定实际维修期限</text></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"运输概念示意\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><path d=\"M25 60H230M25 110H230\" stroke=\"#77978a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M60 85H190\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"65\">流动 / 壁厚 / 能耗 → 数据与机理</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"115\">先核对工况、计量与模型假设</text></g></svg><p>内检测可以提供金属损失和缺陷尺寸等证据，环境和润湿状态可能影响增长。缺陷匹配误差与测量误差会影响跨期评估。</p><p>概念示意，非实际管网、仪表或储罐工程图。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：合成环境、润湿代理与增长率标签。方法：腐蚀增长率回归 + 线性外推。输出：增长率和到假设阈值的外推时间。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>规范缺陷与检测单位</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>拟合环境增长代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>结合当前损失外推</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较固定增长率基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>检测与环境 → 增长率学习 → 损失外推 → 独立验证。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>现场需 合成环境、润湿代理与增长率标签，保留校准、检测或运行来源并统一时钟、单位和参考条件；按独立管段、设备、标定批次或时间块留出验证。</p><p>全部为教学合成数据，代理和正常基线用 400 个独立样本学习；测试种子初始 91，训练种子 17。真实测试标签不进入预测。换井切换独立测量或已知分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不重新训练。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-production/midstream/pipeline-integrity/pipeline-integrity-monitoring-and-leak-detection\">SLB：管道完整性与泄漏监测</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/delivering-digital-at-scale/software/olga/olga-pipeline-management/olga-pipeline-corrosion\">SLB：腐蚀环境影响因素</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归方法原理</a>。简化生成式与代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"管道腐蚀智能评估：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 规范缺陷与检测单位","role":"数据","do":"合成环境、润湿代理与增长率标签统一时钟、单位与数据来源。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 拟合环境增长代理","role":"学习","do":"腐蚀增长率回归 + 线性外推；隔离标定或正常训练数据。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 结合当前损失外推","role":"推理","do":"检测与环境 → 增长率学习 → 损失外推 → 独立验证；实时滑块改变教学条件。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较固定增长率基线","role":"验收","do":"与同条件基线对照并导出 CSV，明确 未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<p>检测与环境 → 增长率学习 → 损失外推 → 独立验证</p><p>检测用 F1、误报及漏报；回归用独立真值 MAE；优化比较同需求功率并检查容量与流量守恒；外推明确假设阈值。异常分数不是经现场校准的事故概率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2932,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>管道腐蚀智能评估</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试工况 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>管道腐蚀智能评估</h1><p class=\"lead\">内检测可以提供金属损失和缺陷尺寸等证据，环境和润湿状态可能影响增长。缺陷匹配误差与测量误差会影响跨期评估。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一组样例 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>教学壁厚损失阈值（mm） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"教学壁厚损失阈值（mm）\" type=\"range\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" value=\"5\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：真值/阈值；绿：模型/校正；蓝：基线或另一传感代理。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>增长率：真值、回归与固定速率基线</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"增长率：真值、回归与固定速率基线\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>到教学损失阈值的线性外推时间</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"到教学损失阈值的线性外推时间\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>腐蚀增长率回归 + 线性外推；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">未实现内检测配准或剩余强度验算，外推时间不是合规寿命或维修期限。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13533,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"corrosion\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":5,\"inspect\":\"增长率mm/年，当前损失与教学阈值单位mm。外推假设当前速率保持不变，时间不等于合规寿命或维修期限，不做剩余强度校核。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),d=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),x,y;if(TYPE==='leak'){x=[1,a];y=.2+3*a+(r()-.5)*.5}else if(TYPE==='corrosion'){x=[1,a,b,a*b];y=.08+.25*a+.12*b+.08*a*b+(r()-.5)*.015}else if(TYPE==='pump'){let q1=a*90,q2=b*80;x=[1,q1,q2,q1*q1,q2*q2];y=2+.08*q1+.1*q2+.003*q1*q1+.004*q2*q2+(r()-.5)}else if(TYPE==='meter'){let actual=50+a*250,temp=b;let observed=actual*1.08+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*.5;x=[1,observed,temp];y=actual}else{x=[1,a];y=(r()-.5)*1.2}d.push({x,y})}let w=fit(d),res=d.map(v=>v.y-predict(w,v.x)),sd=Math.sqrt(res.reduce((s,v)=>s+v*v,0)/res.length);return {w,sd:Math.max(.2,sd)}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction counts(a,t){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&t[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(t[i])fn++});return {f:t.some(Boolean)?(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—（无事件）',fp,fn}}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,n=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=n.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='leak'){let raw=[],score=[],truth=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let change=.5+.4*Math.sin(i/13),event=i>=50&&i<90&&p>0,value=.2+3*change+(event?p:0)+(r()-.5)*n*4,residual=value-predict(model.w,[1,change]),z=residual/model.sd;raw.push(value);score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);alarm.push(z>3?1:0);base.push(value>2.5?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,truth);chart('a',[{values:raw,color:'#43836b'}],-2,15,'分钟采样序号','入口−出口流量差 / m³·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-10,...score)*1.1,Math.max(55,...score)*1.1,'分钟采样序号（事件窗口50–89，零流失时无事件）','扣除管存代理后的残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['学习残差 F1',c.f],['固定流差阈值 F1',counts(base,truth).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['学习正常尺度',model.sd.toFixed(3)+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常运行数据学习压力变化/管存代理与进出流差的关系，再对残差按正常尺度阈值检测。第一滑块为合成未解释流量，第二为传感噪声。异常流差也可能来自标定、时间不同步或模型误差，不能直接确认泄漏；未实现负压波定位或多相管存计算。';head=['minute','flow_imbalance_m3_h','residual_z','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,raw[i],score[i],v,alarm[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='corrosion'){let trueRate=[],rate=[],depth=[],remaining=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let env=i/99,wet=.6,actual=.08+.25*env+.12*wet+.08*env*wet,x=clamp(env+(r()-.5)*n,0,1),est=Math.max(.01,predict(model.w,[1,x,wet,x*wet])),d=1.2+env*.8,year=(p-d)/est;trueRate.push(actual);rate.push(est);depth.push(d);remaining.push(Math.max(0,year));base.push(.25)}chart('a',[{values:trueRate,color:'#c59048'},{values:rate,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,.6,'缺陷编号（0–99）','腐蚀增长率 / mm·年⁻¹（合成）');chart('b',[{values:remaining,color:'#43836b'}],0,Math.max(45,...remaining)*1.05,'缺陷编号','达到教学损失阈值的外推时间 / 年');let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-trueRate[i]),0)/100;metrics([['模型增长率 MAE',mae(rate).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['固定速率 MAE',mae(base).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['损失阈值假设',p+' mm'],['最短外推时间',Math.min(...remaining).toFixed(1)+' 年']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成环境与润湿条件样本训练增长率回归；用当前损失量与预测增长率线性外推到指定损失阈值。第一滑块是教学阈值，第二是环境观测误差。未进行两次内检测缺陷配准或真实剩余强度评定，外推时间不是合规寿命、破裂时间或维修期限。';head=['defect','current_loss_mm','true_rate_mm_y','predicted_rate_mm_y','time_to_assumed_limit_y'];rows=rate.map((v,i)=>[i,depth[i],trueRate[i],v,remaining[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='pump'){let all=[];for(let q1=0;q1<=90;q1++){let q2=p-q1;if(q2<0||q2>80)continue;let power=pumpPower(q1,q2)*(1+n*.2);all.push({q1,q2,power})}let best=all.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.power-b.power)[0],equal=p/2,base=equal<=80?pumpPower(equal,equal)*(1+n*.2):null;chart('a',[{values:all.map(v=>v.power),color:'#43836b'}],0,150,'可行分配序号（第一泵流量递增）','预测总功率 / kW（合成）');chart('b',[{values:[best.q1,best.q2],color:'#43836b'},{values:[equal,equal],color:'#648eae'}],0,100,'泵编号 0 / 1','绿最优 / 蓝均分流量 m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['最优功率',best.power.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['均分基线',base===null?'容量不兼容':base.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['推荐分配',best.q1+' / '+best.q2+' m³/h'],['需求约束',best.q1+best.q2+' / '+p]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成运行点拟合两泵流量与总功率二次代理，在总流量等于需求、单泵不超过 90/80 m³/h 条件下枚举整数分配并最小化预测功率。第二滑块统一增加阻力代价，换井增加已知的分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不变。仅为两泵分流，不是完整管网水力或压缩机优化；未校验扬程、汽蚀、最小流量或启停约束，零流量也保留模型常数项。';head=['pump0_m3_h','pump1_m3_h','predicted_power_kW','selected'];rows=all.map(v=>[v.q1,v.q2,v.power,v===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='meter'){let truth=[],raw=[],correct=[],temperature=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let actual=80+i*2,temp=.5+.3*Math.sin(i/12),reading=actual*(1.08+p/100)+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*n*10;truth.push(actual);raw.push(reading);correct.push(predict(model.w,[1,reading,temp]));temperature.push(temp)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100;chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:raw,color:'#648eae'},{values:correct,color:'#43836b'}],0,380,'独立测试点序号','流量 / m³·h⁻¹（统一参考条件）');chart('b',[{values:raw.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#648eae'},{values:correct.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#43836b'}],-20,100,'测试点序号','校正前后误差 / m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['校正 MAE',mae(correct).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['原始读数 MAE',mae(raw).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['学得读数系数',model.w[1].toFixed(4)],['测试新增增益漂移',p+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个独立参考标定点学习“读数+温度代理→参考流量”的线性校正。第一滑块只改变标定后的测试增益漂移，第二增加测试读数噪声；固定校正会在漂移增加时失准，不能无条件沿用。不是多相流率反演或标准温压换算，不自动修改真实仪表系数。橙参考、蓝原读数、绿校正。';head=['sample','reference_m3_h','raw_m3_h','corrected_m3_h','temperature_proxy'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,raw[i],correct[i],temperature[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='tank'){let level=4,truth=[],radar=[],vision=[],leaks=[],score=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<90&&p>0;level+=(2-(event?p:0))/60/50;truth.push(level);radar.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.01);vision.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.02);leaks.push(event?1:0)}for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let residual=i>=5?(radar[i-5]+2*5/60/50-radar[i])*50/(5/60):0,z=(residual-predict(model.w,[1,.5]))/model.sd;score.push(z);alarm.push(i>=5&&z>3?1:0);base.push(radar[i]<3.95?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,leaks);chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:radar,color:'#43836b'},{values:vision,color:'#648eae'}],3.7,4.2,'分钟序号（零流失时无事件）','橙真值 / 绿雷达 / 蓝视觉代理液位 m');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-15,...score)*1.1,Math.max(40,...score)*1.1,'分钟序号（5 分钟滑窗）','液位物料平衡残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['残差检测 F1',c.f],['低液位基线 F1',counts(base,leaks).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['合成未解释流失',p+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='假设罐截面积 50 m²、净入流 2 m³/h，以五分钟雷达液位变化核对物料平衡，正常残差尺度从 400 点学习。蓝色视觉读数只是独立数值传感代理，当前不参与报警，未实现视频读数/OCR。第一滑块为未知流失量，第二为液位测量噪声；残差异常也可能来自传感故障或流量计误差，不能直接确认泄漏。滑窗使事件边缘出现延迟与拖尾。';head=['minute','true_level_m','radar_level_m','visual_proxy_level_m','truth_event','residual_score','alarm','low_level_alarm'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,radar[i],vision[i],leaks[i],score[i],alarm[i],base[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='transport-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent='固定独立训练系数：'+JSON.stringify(model.w)+'；学习残差尺度 '+model.sd.toFixed(5)+(TYPE==='pump'?'；本井附加阻力修正等级 '+((seed-91)%11):'')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='leak'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='corrosion'?r[3]-r[2]:TYPE==='pump'?r[2]:TYPE==='meter'?r[3]-r[1]:+(r[4]!==r[6])),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='leak'||TYPE==='tank'?'逐分钟误报/漏报位置（高柱为判错）':TYPE==='corrosion'?'预测增长率−合成真值 / mm·年⁻¹':TYPE==='pump'?'满足同需求与容量约束的各候选功率 / kW':'校正后读数−参考值 / m³·h⁻¹';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(.5,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.5,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\nfunction pumpPower(a,b){return predict(model.w,[1,a,b,a*a,b*b])+((seed-91)%11)*(.00025*a*a+.00008*b*b)}\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].status="full";}
{const c={"id":"transport-pump-v22","sceneId":"t3","title":"集输系统工况优化：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"集输泵的分配影响能耗，但实际运行还受扬程、压力和设备工况范围限制。优化应先满足输送约束，再比较能耗。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"功率代理 + 两泵约束分流","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"固定需求下的分流方案与功率","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"集输系统工况优化专业概念\"><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\"><path d=\"M25 80H100V35H270V80H335M100 80V130H270V80\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"35\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#e5efe8\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"130\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#e5efe8\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"55\">q₁+q₂ = 固定输送需求</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"100\">先满足容量，再比较总功率</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"140\">同需求均分基线，避免偷换总量</text></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"运输概念示意\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><path d=\"M25 60H230M25 110H230\" stroke=\"#77978a\" stroke-width=\"8\"/><path d=\"M60 85H190\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"65\">流动 / 壁厚 / 能耗 → 数据与机理</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"115\">先核对工况、计量与模型假设</text></g></svg><p>集输泵的分配影响能耗，但实际运行还受扬程、压力和设备工况范围限制。优化应先满足输送约束，再比较能耗。</p><p>概念示意，非实际管网、仪表或储罐工程图。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：两泵分流量与合成总功率标签。方法：功率代理 + 两泵约束分流。输出：固定需求下的分流方案与功率。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>收集独立运行样本</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习二次功率代理</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>枚举同需求可行分配</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较同需求均分基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>运行样本 → 功率代理 → 容量筛选 → 需求约束优化。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>现场需 两泵分流量与合成总功率标签，保留校准、检测或运行来源并统一时钟、单位和参考条件；按独立管段、设备、标定批次或时间块留出验证。</p><p>全部为教学合成数据，代理和正常基线用 400 个独立样本学习；测试种子初始 91，训练种子 17。真实测试标签不进入预测。换井切换独立测量或已知分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不重新训练。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-production/midstream/pipeline-integrity/pipeline-integrity-monitoring-and-leak-detection\">SLB：管道完整性与泄漏监测</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/delivering-digital-at-scale/software/olga/olga-pipeline-management/olga-pipeline-corrosion\">SLB：腐蚀环境影响因素</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归方法原理</a>。简化生成式与代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"集输系统工况优化：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 收集独立运行样本","role":"数据","do":"两泵分流量与合成总功率标签统一时钟、单位与数据来源。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习二次功率代理","role":"学习","do":"功率代理 + 两泵约束分流；隔离标定或正常训练数据。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 枚举同需求可行分配","role":"推理","do":"运行样本 → 功率代理 → 容量筛选 → 需求约束优化；实时滑块改变教学条件。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较同需求均分基线","role":"验收","do":"与同条件基线对照并导出 CSV，明确 仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<p>运行样本 → 功率代理 → 容量筛选 → 需求约束优化</p><p>检测用 F1、误报及漏报；回归用独立真值 MAE；优化比较同需求功率并检查容量与流量守恒；外推明确假设阈值。异常分数不是经现场校准的事故概率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2880,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>集输系统工况优化</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试工况 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>集输系统工况优化</h1><p class=\"lead\">集输泵的分配影响能耗，但实际运行还受扬程、压力和设备工况范围限制。优化应先满足输送约束，再比较能耗。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一组样例 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>输送需求（m³/h） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"输送需求（m³/h）\" type=\"range\" min=\"30\" max=\"150\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>附加阻力代价 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：真值/阈值；绿：模型/校正；蓝：基线或另一传感代理。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>满足同需求的两泵分流候选功率</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"满足同需求的两泵分流候选功率\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>最优分流与同需求均分对照</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"最优分流与同需求均分对照\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>功率代理 + 两泵约束分流；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">仅模拟两泵分流，不进行完整水力、汽蚀、启停和最小流量校验。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13527,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"pump\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":100,\"inspect\":\"两泵流量m³/h，总功率kW为合成代理。候选严格满足需求和90/80单泵容量；selected为最低预测功率候选，不校验完整水力条件。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),d=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),x,y;if(TYPE==='leak'){x=[1,a];y=.2+3*a+(r()-.5)*.5}else if(TYPE==='corrosion'){x=[1,a,b,a*b];y=.08+.25*a+.12*b+.08*a*b+(r()-.5)*.015}else if(TYPE==='pump'){let q1=a*90,q2=b*80;x=[1,q1,q2,q1*q1,q2*q2];y=2+.08*q1+.1*q2+.003*q1*q1+.004*q2*q2+(r()-.5)}else if(TYPE==='meter'){let actual=50+a*250,temp=b;let observed=actual*1.08+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*.5;x=[1,observed,temp];y=actual}else{x=[1,a];y=(r()-.5)*1.2}d.push({x,y})}let w=fit(d),res=d.map(v=>v.y-predict(w,v.x)),sd=Math.sqrt(res.reduce((s,v)=>s+v*v,0)/res.length);return {w,sd:Math.max(.2,sd)}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction counts(a,t){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&t[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(t[i])fn++});return {f:t.some(Boolean)?(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—（无事件）',fp,fn}}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,n=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=n.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='leak'){let raw=[],score=[],truth=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let change=.5+.4*Math.sin(i/13),event=i>=50&&i<90&&p>0,value=.2+3*change+(event?p:0)+(r()-.5)*n*4,residual=value-predict(model.w,[1,change]),z=residual/model.sd;raw.push(value);score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);alarm.push(z>3?1:0);base.push(value>2.5?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,truth);chart('a',[{values:raw,color:'#43836b'}],-2,15,'分钟采样序号','入口−出口流量差 / m³·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-10,...score)*1.1,Math.max(55,...score)*1.1,'分钟采样序号（事件窗口50–89，零流失时无事件）','扣除管存代理后的残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['学习残差 F1',c.f],['固定流差阈值 F1',counts(base,truth).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['学习正常尺度',model.sd.toFixed(3)+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常运行数据学习压力变化/管存代理与进出流差的关系，再对残差按正常尺度阈值检测。第一滑块为合成未解释流量，第二为传感噪声。异常流差也可能来自标定、时间不同步或模型误差，不能直接确认泄漏；未实现负压波定位或多相管存计算。';head=['minute','flow_imbalance_m3_h','residual_z','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,raw[i],score[i],v,alarm[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='corrosion'){let trueRate=[],rate=[],depth=[],remaining=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let env=i/99,wet=.6,actual=.08+.25*env+.12*wet+.08*env*wet,x=clamp(env+(r()-.5)*n,0,1),est=Math.max(.01,predict(model.w,[1,x,wet,x*wet])),d=1.2+env*.8,year=(p-d)/est;trueRate.push(actual);rate.push(est);depth.push(d);remaining.push(Math.max(0,year));base.push(.25)}chart('a',[{values:trueRate,color:'#c59048'},{values:rate,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,.6,'缺陷编号（0–99）','腐蚀增长率 / mm·年⁻¹（合成）');chart('b',[{values:remaining,color:'#43836b'}],0,Math.max(45,...remaining)*1.05,'缺陷编号','达到教学损失阈值的外推时间 / 年');let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-trueRate[i]),0)/100;metrics([['模型增长率 MAE',mae(rate).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['固定速率 MAE',mae(base).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['损失阈值假设',p+' mm'],['最短外推时间',Math.min(...remaining).toFixed(1)+' 年']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成环境与润湿条件样本训练增长率回归；用当前损失量与预测增长率线性外推到指定损失阈值。第一滑块是教学阈值，第二是环境观测误差。未进行两次内检测缺陷配准或真实剩余强度评定，外推时间不是合规寿命、破裂时间或维修期限。';head=['defect','current_loss_mm','true_rate_mm_y','predicted_rate_mm_y','time_to_assumed_limit_y'];rows=rate.map((v,i)=>[i,depth[i],trueRate[i],v,remaining[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='pump'){let all=[];for(let q1=0;q1<=90;q1++){let q2=p-q1;if(q2<0||q2>80)continue;let power=pumpPower(q1,q2)*(1+n*.2);all.push({q1,q2,power})}let best=all.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.power-b.power)[0],equal=p/2,base=equal<=80?pumpPower(equal,equal)*(1+n*.2):null;chart('a',[{values:all.map(v=>v.power),color:'#43836b'}],0,150,'可行分配序号（第一泵流量递增）','预测总功率 / kW（合成）');chart('b',[{values:[best.q1,best.q2],color:'#43836b'},{values:[equal,equal],color:'#648eae'}],0,100,'泵编号 0 / 1','绿最优 / 蓝均分流量 m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['最优功率',best.power.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['均分基线',base===null?'容量不兼容':base.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['推荐分配',best.q1+' / '+best.q2+' m³/h'],['需求约束',best.q1+best.q2+' / '+p]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成运行点拟合两泵流量与总功率二次代理，在总流量等于需求、单泵不超过 90/80 m³/h 条件下枚举整数分配并最小化预测功率。第二滑块统一增加阻力代价，换井增加已知的分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不变。仅为两泵分流，不是完整管网水力或压缩机优化；未校验扬程、汽蚀、最小流量或启停约束，零流量也保留模型常数项。';head=['pump0_m3_h','pump1_m3_h','predicted_power_kW','selected'];rows=all.map(v=>[v.q1,v.q2,v.power,v===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='meter'){let truth=[],raw=[],correct=[],temperature=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let actual=80+i*2,temp=.5+.3*Math.sin(i/12),reading=actual*(1.08+p/100)+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*n*10;truth.push(actual);raw.push(reading);correct.push(predict(model.w,[1,reading,temp]));temperature.push(temp)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100;chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:raw,color:'#648eae'},{values:correct,color:'#43836b'}],0,380,'独立测试点序号','流量 / m³·h⁻¹（统一参考条件）');chart('b',[{values:raw.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#648eae'},{values:correct.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#43836b'}],-20,100,'测试点序号','校正前后误差 / m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['校正 MAE',mae(correct).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['原始读数 MAE',mae(raw).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['学得读数系数',model.w[1].toFixed(4)],['测试新增增益漂移',p+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个独立参考标定点学习“读数+温度代理→参考流量”的线性校正。第一滑块只改变标定后的测试增益漂移，第二增加测试读数噪声；固定校正会在漂移增加时失准，不能无条件沿用。不是多相流率反演或标准温压换算，不自动修改真实仪表系数。橙参考、蓝原读数、绿校正。';head=['sample','reference_m3_h','raw_m3_h','corrected_m3_h','temperature_proxy'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,raw[i],correct[i],temperature[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='tank'){let level=4,truth=[],radar=[],vision=[],leaks=[],score=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<90&&p>0;level+=(2-(event?p:0))/60/50;truth.push(level);radar.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.01);vision.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.02);leaks.push(event?1:0)}for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let residual=i>=5?(radar[i-5]+2*5/60/50-radar[i])*50/(5/60):0,z=(residual-predict(model.w,[1,.5]))/model.sd;score.push(z);alarm.push(i>=5&&z>3?1:0);base.push(radar[i]<3.95?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,leaks);chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:radar,color:'#43836b'},{values:vision,color:'#648eae'}],3.7,4.2,'分钟序号（零流失时无事件）','橙真值 / 绿雷达 / 蓝视觉代理液位 m');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-15,...score)*1.1,Math.max(40,...score)*1.1,'分钟序号（5 分钟滑窗）','液位物料平衡残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['残差检测 F1',c.f],['低液位基线 F1',counts(base,leaks).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['合成未解释流失',p+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='假设罐截面积 50 m²、净入流 2 m³/h，以五分钟雷达液位变化核对物料平衡，正常残差尺度从 400 点学习。蓝色视觉读数只是独立数值传感代理，当前不参与报警，未实现视频读数/OCR。第一滑块为未知流失量，第二为液位测量噪声；残差异常也可能来自传感故障或流量计误差，不能直接确认泄漏。滑窗使事件边缘出现延迟与拖尾。';head=['minute','true_level_m','radar_level_m','visual_proxy_level_m','truth_event','residual_score','alarm','low_level_alarm'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,radar[i],vision[i],leaks[i],score[i],alarm[i],base[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='transport-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent='固定独立训练系数：'+JSON.stringify(model.w)+'；学习残差尺度 '+model.sd.toFixed(5)+(TYPE==='pump'?'；本井附加阻力修正等级 '+((seed-91)%11):'')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='leak'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='corrosion'?r[3]-r[2]:TYPE==='pump'?r[2]:TYPE==='meter'?r[3]-r[1]:+(r[4]!==r[6])),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='leak'||TYPE==='tank'?'逐分钟误报/漏报位置（高柱为判错）':TYPE==='corrosion'?'预测增长率−合成真值 / mm·年⁻¹':TYPE==='pump'?'满足同需求与容量约束的各候选功率 / kW':'校正后读数−参考值 / m³·h⁻¹';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(.5,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.5,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\nfunction pumpPower(a,b){return predict(model.w,[1,a,b,a*a,b*b])+((seed-91)%11)*(.00025*a*a+.00008*b*b)}\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].status="full";}
{const c={"id":"transport-meter-v22","sceneId":"t4","title":"油气计量智能校正：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"计量读数可能受增益偏移、温度响应和仪表状态影响。基于参考标定的校正能减少某些误差，但标定后的新漂移仍会破坏关系。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"参考标定监督回归","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"校正流量与漂移后的误差","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"油气计量智能校正专业概念\"><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"35\" width=\"230\" height=\"95\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"75\">参考流量 / 仪表读数</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"110\">温度代理 / 标定来源</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"55\">独立标定 → 固定校正关系</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"100\">新增漂移可能让原关系失准</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"140\">校正后仍需参考验证</text></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"运输概念示意\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><text x=\"25\" y=\"60\">参考标定</text><path d=\"M135 55H235\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"60\">读数 + 温度 → 校正系数</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"120\">新增漂移 → 原校正关系失准 → 独立验证</text></g></svg><p>计量读数可能受增益偏移、温度响应和仪表状态影响。基于参考标定的校正能减少某些误差，但标定后的新漂移仍会破坏关系。</p><p>概念示意，非实际管网、仪表或储罐工程图。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：参考流量、仪表读数与温度代理。方法：参考标定监督回归。输出：校正流量与漂移后的误差。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>统一参考条件与单位</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>拟合标定回归</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>固定模型检测新漂移</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>比较校正前后误差</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>参考标定 → 学习系数 → 独立漂移测试 → 维护复核。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>现场需 参考流量、仪表读数与温度代理，保留校准、检测或运行来源并统一时钟、单位和参考条件；按独立管段、设备、标定批次或时间块留出验证。</p><p>全部为教学合成数据，代理和正常基线用 400 个独立样本学习；测试种子初始 91，训练种子 17。真实测试标签不进入预测。换井切换独立测量或已知分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不重新训练。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-production/midstream/pipeline-integrity/pipeline-integrity-monitoring-and-leak-detection\">SLB：管道完整性与泄漏监测</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/delivering-digital-at-scale/software/olga/olga-pipeline-management/olga-pipeline-corrosion\">SLB：腐蚀环境影响因素</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归方法原理</a>。简化生成式与代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"油气计量智能校正：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 统一参考条件与单位","role":"数据","do":"参考流量、仪表读数与温度代理统一时钟、单位与数据来源。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 拟合标定回归","role":"学习","do":"参考标定监督回归；隔离标定或正常训练数据。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 固定模型检测新漂移","role":"推理","do":"参考标定 → 学习系数 → 独立漂移测试 → 维护复核；实时滑块改变教学条件。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 比较校正前后误差","role":"验收","do":"与同条件基线对照并导出 CSV，明确 不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<p>参考标定 → 学习系数 → 独立漂移测试 → 维护复核</p><p>检测用 F1、误报及漏报；回归用独立真值 MAE；优化比较同需求功率并检查容量与流量守恒；外推明确假设阈值。异常分数不是经现场校准的事故概率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2904,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>油气计量智能校正</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试工况 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>油气计量智能校正</h1><p class=\"lead\">计量读数可能受增益偏移、温度响应和仪表状态影响。基于参考标定的校正能减少某些误差，但标定后的新漂移仍会破坏关系。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一组样例 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>测试新增增益漂移（%） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"测试新增增益漂移（%）\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" value=\"3\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：真值/阈值；绿：模型/校正；蓝：基线或另一传感代理。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>参考流量、原始读数与校正结果</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"参考流量、原始读数与校正结果\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>标定后新增漂移下的校正前后误差</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"标定后新增漂移下的校正前后误差\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>参考标定监督回归；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">不实现多相计量或标准温压换算，不自动改真实仪表参数。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13520,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"meter\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":3,\"inspect\":\"参考、原读数和校正流量均为m³/h。标定后的新增漂移只作用测试读数；固定校正关系可能失准，不自动改动真实仪表。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),d=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),x,y;if(TYPE==='leak'){x=[1,a];y=.2+3*a+(r()-.5)*.5}else if(TYPE==='corrosion'){x=[1,a,b,a*b];y=.08+.25*a+.12*b+.08*a*b+(r()-.5)*.015}else if(TYPE==='pump'){let q1=a*90,q2=b*80;x=[1,q1,q2,q1*q1,q2*q2];y=2+.08*q1+.1*q2+.003*q1*q1+.004*q2*q2+(r()-.5)}else if(TYPE==='meter'){let actual=50+a*250,temp=b;let observed=actual*1.08+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*.5;x=[1,observed,temp];y=actual}else{x=[1,a];y=(r()-.5)*1.2}d.push({x,y})}let w=fit(d),res=d.map(v=>v.y-predict(w,v.x)),sd=Math.sqrt(res.reduce((s,v)=>s+v*v,0)/res.length);return {w,sd:Math.max(.2,sd)}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction counts(a,t){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&t[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(t[i])fn++});return {f:t.some(Boolean)?(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—（无事件）',fp,fn}}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,n=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=n.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='leak'){let raw=[],score=[],truth=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let change=.5+.4*Math.sin(i/13),event=i>=50&&i<90&&p>0,value=.2+3*change+(event?p:0)+(r()-.5)*n*4,residual=value-predict(model.w,[1,change]),z=residual/model.sd;raw.push(value);score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);alarm.push(z>3?1:0);base.push(value>2.5?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,truth);chart('a',[{values:raw,color:'#43836b'}],-2,15,'分钟采样序号','入口−出口流量差 / m³·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-10,...score)*1.1,Math.max(55,...score)*1.1,'分钟采样序号（事件窗口50–89，零流失时无事件）','扣除管存代理后的残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['学习残差 F1',c.f],['固定流差阈值 F1',counts(base,truth).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['学习正常尺度',model.sd.toFixed(3)+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常运行数据学习压力变化/管存代理与进出流差的关系，再对残差按正常尺度阈值检测。第一滑块为合成未解释流量，第二为传感噪声。异常流差也可能来自标定、时间不同步或模型误差，不能直接确认泄漏；未实现负压波定位或多相管存计算。';head=['minute','flow_imbalance_m3_h','residual_z','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,raw[i],score[i],v,alarm[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='corrosion'){let trueRate=[],rate=[],depth=[],remaining=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let env=i/99,wet=.6,actual=.08+.25*env+.12*wet+.08*env*wet,x=clamp(env+(r()-.5)*n,0,1),est=Math.max(.01,predict(model.w,[1,x,wet,x*wet])),d=1.2+env*.8,year=(p-d)/est;trueRate.push(actual);rate.push(est);depth.push(d);remaining.push(Math.max(0,year));base.push(.25)}chart('a',[{values:trueRate,color:'#c59048'},{values:rate,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,.6,'缺陷编号（0–99）','腐蚀增长率 / mm·年⁻¹（合成）');chart('b',[{values:remaining,color:'#43836b'}],0,Math.max(45,...remaining)*1.05,'缺陷编号','达到教学损失阈值的外推时间 / 年');let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-trueRate[i]),0)/100;metrics([['模型增长率 MAE',mae(rate).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['固定速率 MAE',mae(base).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['损失阈值假设',p+' mm'],['最短外推时间',Math.min(...remaining).toFixed(1)+' 年']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成环境与润湿条件样本训练增长率回归；用当前损失量与预测增长率线性外推到指定损失阈值。第一滑块是教学阈值，第二是环境观测误差。未进行两次内检测缺陷配准或真实剩余强度评定，外推时间不是合规寿命、破裂时间或维修期限。';head=['defect','current_loss_mm','true_rate_mm_y','predicted_rate_mm_y','time_to_assumed_limit_y'];rows=rate.map((v,i)=>[i,depth[i],trueRate[i],v,remaining[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='pump'){let all=[];for(let q1=0;q1<=90;q1++){let q2=p-q1;if(q2<0||q2>80)continue;let power=pumpPower(q1,q2)*(1+n*.2);all.push({q1,q2,power})}let best=all.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.power-b.power)[0],equal=p/2,base=equal<=80?pumpPower(equal,equal)*(1+n*.2):null;chart('a',[{values:all.map(v=>v.power),color:'#43836b'}],0,150,'可行分配序号（第一泵流量递增）','预测总功率 / kW（合成）');chart('b',[{values:[best.q1,best.q2],color:'#43836b'},{values:[equal,equal],color:'#648eae'}],0,100,'泵编号 0 / 1','绿最优 / 蓝均分流量 m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['最优功率',best.power.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['均分基线',base===null?'容量不兼容':base.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['推荐分配',best.q1+' / '+best.q2+' m³/h'],['需求约束',best.q1+best.q2+' / '+p]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成运行点拟合两泵流量与总功率二次代理，在总流量等于需求、单泵不超过 90/80 m³/h 条件下枚举整数分配并最小化预测功率。第二滑块统一增加阻力代价，换井增加已知的分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不变。仅为两泵分流，不是完整管网水力或压缩机优化；未校验扬程、汽蚀、最小流量或启停约束，零流量也保留模型常数项。';head=['pump0_m3_h','pump1_m3_h','predicted_power_kW','selected'];rows=all.map(v=>[v.q1,v.q2,v.power,v===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='meter'){let truth=[],raw=[],correct=[],temperature=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let actual=80+i*2,temp=.5+.3*Math.sin(i/12),reading=actual*(1.08+p/100)+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*n*10;truth.push(actual);raw.push(reading);correct.push(predict(model.w,[1,reading,temp]));temperature.push(temp)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100;chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:raw,color:'#648eae'},{values:correct,color:'#43836b'}],0,380,'独立测试点序号','流量 / m³·h⁻¹（统一参考条件）');chart('b',[{values:raw.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#648eae'},{values:correct.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#43836b'}],-20,100,'测试点序号','校正前后误差 / m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['校正 MAE',mae(correct).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['原始读数 MAE',mae(raw).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['学得读数系数',model.w[1].toFixed(4)],['测试新增增益漂移',p+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个独立参考标定点学习“读数+温度代理→参考流量”的线性校正。第一滑块只改变标定后的测试增益漂移，第二增加测试读数噪声；固定校正会在漂移增加时失准，不能无条件沿用。不是多相流率反演或标准温压换算，不自动修改真实仪表系数。橙参考、蓝原读数、绿校正。';head=['sample','reference_m3_h','raw_m3_h','corrected_m3_h','temperature_proxy'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,raw[i],correct[i],temperature[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='tank'){let level=4,truth=[],radar=[],vision=[],leaks=[],score=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<90&&p>0;level+=(2-(event?p:0))/60/50;truth.push(level);radar.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.01);vision.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.02);leaks.push(event?1:0)}for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let residual=i>=5?(radar[i-5]+2*5/60/50-radar[i])*50/(5/60):0,z=(residual-predict(model.w,[1,.5]))/model.sd;score.push(z);alarm.push(i>=5&&z>3?1:0);base.push(radar[i]<3.95?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,leaks);chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:radar,color:'#43836b'},{values:vision,color:'#648eae'}],3.7,4.2,'分钟序号（零流失时无事件）','橙真值 / 绿雷达 / 蓝视觉代理液位 m');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-15,...score)*1.1,Math.max(40,...score)*1.1,'分钟序号（5 分钟滑窗）','液位物料平衡残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['残差检测 F1',c.f],['低液位基线 F1',counts(base,leaks).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['合成未解释流失',p+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='假设罐截面积 50 m²、净入流 2 m³/h，以五分钟雷达液位变化核对物料平衡，正常残差尺度从 400 点学习。蓝色视觉读数只是独立数值传感代理，当前不参与报警，未实现视频读数/OCR。第一滑块为未知流失量，第二为液位测量噪声；残差异常也可能来自传感故障或流量计误差，不能直接确认泄漏。滑窗使事件边缘出现延迟与拖尾。';head=['minute','true_level_m','radar_level_m','visual_proxy_level_m','truth_event','residual_score','alarm','low_level_alarm'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,radar[i],vision[i],leaks[i],score[i],alarm[i],base[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='transport-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent='固定独立训练系数：'+JSON.stringify(model.w)+'；学习残差尺度 '+model.sd.toFixed(5)+(TYPE==='pump'?'；本井附加阻力修正等级 '+((seed-91)%11):'')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='leak'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='corrosion'?r[3]-r[2]:TYPE==='pump'?r[2]:TYPE==='meter'?r[3]-r[1]:+(r[4]!==r[6])),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='leak'||TYPE==='tank'?'逐分钟误报/漏报位置（高柱为判错）':TYPE==='corrosion'?'预测增长率−合成真值 / mm·年⁻¹':TYPE==='pump'?'满足同需求与容量约束的各候选功率 / kW':'校正后读数−参考值 / m³·h⁻¹';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(.5,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.5,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\nfunction pumpPower(a,b){return predict(model.w,[1,a,b,a*a,b*b])+((seed-91)%11)*(.00025*a*a+.00008*b*b)}\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].status="full";}
{const c={"id":"transport-tank-v22","sceneId":"t5","title":"储罐液位与泄漏智能监控：交互式学习实验","status":"ready","version":"2.2.0","updated":"2026-11-02","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","lede":"储罐液位变化应与净入流和罐体几何相符。多传感器可以帮助核对读数，但液位异常也可能由计量和传感故障引起。","judge":[{"label":"方法","value":"物料平衡 + 学习正常残差","desc":"纯前端实际计算"},{"label":"数据","value":"教学合成","desc":"独立训练与测试"},{"label":"输出","value":"五分钟残差报警与读数对照","desc":"可视化与 CSV"},{"label":"范围","value":"教学演示","desc":"视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。"}],"sections":[{"no":1,"en":"CONCEPT","title":"专业概念与背景","html":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 165\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"储罐液位与泄漏智能监控专业概念\"><g fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\"><path d=\"M35 25V140H200V25\" fill=\"#e5efe8\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M38 85H198\" stroke=\"#41699b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"55\">Δ液位 × 面积 ↔ 净入流 × 时间</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"100\">五分钟窗口降低噪声，也产生延迟</text><text x=\"280\" y=\"140\">多读数对照不等于已确认流失原因</text></g></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"运输概念示意\"><g font-size=\"17\" fill=\"#345647\"><path d=\"M40 25V140H180V25Z\" fill=\"#e3efdc\" stroke=\"#43836b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><path d=\"M42 85H178\" stroke=\"#648eae\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"60\">净入流 → 库存变化 → 液位变化</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"110\">雷达 / 视觉代理对照，不替代实际图像检测</text></g></svg><p>储罐液位变化应与净入流和罐体几何相符。多传感器可以帮助核对读数，但液位异常也可能由计量和传感故障引起。</p><p>概念示意，非实际管网、仪表或储罐工程图。</p>"},{"no":2,"en":"AI","title":"方法与介入点","html":"<p>输入：雷达液位、视觉读数代理与已知净入流。方法：物料平衡 + 学习正常残差。输出：五分钟残差报警与读数对照。</p><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px\"><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>01</b><p>对齐液位和流量时间</p><small>输入与标签</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>02</b><p>学习正常残差尺度</p><small>模型与特征</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>03</b><p>按五分钟物料平衡检测</p><small>预测与决策</small></div><div style=\"background:#e6efe3;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:135px\"><b>04</b><p>显示双读数与低位基线</p><small>误差与来源</small></div></div><p>净入流与几何 → 液位预测 → 窗口残差 → 多源复核。</p>"},{"no":3,"en":"DATA","title":"数据要求与验证","html":"<p>现场需 雷达液位、视觉读数代理与已知净入流，保留校准、检测或运行来源并统一时钟、单位和参考条件；按独立管段、设备、标定批次或时间块留出验证。</p><p>全部为教学合成数据，代理和正常基线用 400 个独立样本学习；测试种子初始 91，训练种子 17。真实测试标签不进入预测。换井切换独立测量或已知分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不重新训练。</p>"},{"no":4,"en":"LIMIT","title":"局限与参考","html":"<p>视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-production/midstream/pipeline-integrity/pipeline-integrity-monitoring-and-leak-detection\">SLB：管道完整性与泄漏监测</a>；<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/delivering-digital-at-scale/software/olga/olga-pipeline-management/olga-pipeline-corrosion\">SLB：腐蚀环境影响因素</a>；<a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\">回归方法原理</a>。简化生成式与代码为独立教学实现。</p>"}]},"workflow":{"label":"案例流程","title":"储罐液位与泄漏智能监控：输入到验收","lead":["每一步均对应演示里的计算或证据。调节滑块观察成像、噪声、平滑或审核阈值的影响。"],"stats":[["运行","浏览器"],["数据","合成"],["输出","可导出"]],"steps":[{"name":"01 对齐液位和流量时间","role":"数据","do":"雷达液位、视觉读数代理与已知净入流统一时钟、单位与数据来源。","effect":"规范输入及标签","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"02 学习正常残差尺度","role":"学习","do":"物料平衡 + 学习正常残差；隔离标定或正常训练数据。","effect":"可复用的训练模型","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"03 按五分钟物料平衡检测","role":"推理","do":"净入流与几何 → 液位预测 → 窗口残差 → 多源复核；实时滑块改变教学条件。","effect":"可视预测与候选","trap":"现场需统一单位、校准采集条件，按井或样品留出验证。"},{"name":"04 显示双读数与低位基线","role":"验收","do":"与同条件基线对照并导出 CSV，明确 视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。","effect":"基线比较或来源审核","trap":"视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。"}],"metrics":{"title":"步骤映射与评价口径","html":"<p>净入流与几何 → 液位预测 → 窗口残差 → 多源复核</p><p>检测用 F1、误报及漏报；回归用独立真值 MAE；优化比较同需求功率并检查容量与流量守恒；外推明确假设阈值。异常分数不是经现场校准的事故概率。</p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 105\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"数据到决策与验收\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">独立资料</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">学习模型</text><rect x=\"360\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e5efe8\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">候选 / 预测</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"10\" width=\"165\" height=\"75\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eee8db\"/><text x=\"552\" y=\"53\" fill=\"#354449\" font-size=\"14\">误差与约束复核</text></svg>"},"fails":[{"name":"采集与工况变化","why":"井况、浆体与地层压力变化可影响结果。"},{"name":"标签与对齐","why":"深度归位、采样尺度与人工解释歧义可能影响真值。"},{"name":"边界","why":"视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。"}]},"demo":{"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850}}},demo={"label":"可运行示范","mode":"page","html":"demo/index.html","height":850},files=[{"name":"demo/index.html","size":2924,"enc":"text","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>储罐液位与泄漏智能监控</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"demo.css\"></head><body><div class=\"panel\"><header class=\"demo-head\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">独立合成测试工况 · 种子 <span id=\"seed\"></span></span><h1>储罐液位与泄漏智能监控</h1><p class=\"lead\">储罐液位变化应与净入流和罐体几何相符。多传感器可以帮助核对读数，但液位异常也可能由计量和传感故障引起。</p></div><button id=\"new\" class=\"btn primary\">换一组样例 ↻</button></header><div class=\"demo-controls\"><div class=\"ctl\"><label>合成未解释流失（m³/h） <output id=\"pv\"></output></label><input id=\"param\" aria-label=\"合成未解释流失（m³/h）\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\"></div><div class=\"ctl\"><label>观测噪声 <output id=\"nv\"></output></label><input id=\"noise\" aria-label=\"噪声\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"20\"></div></div><div class=\"demo-body\"><section class=\"demo-charts charts\"><div class=\"legend\">橙：真值/阈值；绿：模型/校正；蓝：基线或另一传感代理。各图按标注单位读取。</div><figure><figcaption>真实液位、雷达和视觉数值代理</figcaption><canvas id=\"a\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"真实液位、雷达和视觉数值代理\"></canvas></figure><figure><figcaption>五分钟物料平衡残差与报警阈值</figcaption><canvas id=\"b\" width=\"640\" height=\"340\" aria-label=\"五分钟物料平衡残差与报警阈值\"></canvas></figure><svg id=\"diagnostic\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"逐点误差分析\"></svg></section><aside class=\"demo-results\"><div id=\"metrics\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><p class=\"note\" id=\"explain\"></p><pre id=\"report\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:12px/1.9 inherit\"></pre><section class=\"inspect\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>逐点核对：计算结果与依据</h2><span id=\"position\"></span></div><label class=\"point-control\">选择位置<input id=\"point\" aria-label=\"核对位置\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"89\" value=\"25\"></label><div id=\"point-values\" class=\"point-values\"></div><p id=\"point-explain\"></p></section><details><summary>展开模型系数与结果明细</summary><p>物料平衡 + 学习正常残差；训练/优化依据见实际模型明细，换井不重新训练。</p><p id=\"coeff\" class=\"coeff\"></p><div id=\"details\"></div></details><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"run\">重新计算</button><button id=\"reset\">恢复默认</button><button id=\"csv\">导出本次 CSV</button></div><p class=\"note\">视觉仅为数值代理，不实现视频识别；异常残差不等于已确认泄漏。 全部数据为合成教学资料，结果需要独立井验证和人工复核。</p></aside></div></div><script src=\"demo.js\"></script></body></html>","mime":"text/html"},{"name":"demo/demo.css","size":7919,"enc":"text","data":"/* 示范页样式。运行在沙箱 iframe 里，随便写，不影响主站。 */\n:root{\n  --ink:#242b2e; --ink-2:#4d565b; --ink-3:#79828a;\n  --line:#e9e4d8; --jade:#2f7d6b; --jade-l:#e6f1ec;\n  --clay:#b26a39; --paper:#fbfaf6;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{\n  margin:0;padding:18px 20px 24px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:\"Inter\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n  font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;\n}\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}\nh1{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.lead{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.78}\n.ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:9px}\n.ctl label{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-width:170px}\n.ctl output{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}\n.ctl input[type=range]{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade);height:18px}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff}\n#ratio{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}\n.readouts{\n  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;\n  background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\n  margin-top:12px;\n}\n.ro{background:#fff;padding:9px 12px}\n.ro .k{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.ro b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.ro b.ok{color:var(--jade)}\n.ro b.bad{color:var(--clay)}\n.note{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-3);line-height:1.75}\n.note b{color:var(--ink)}\n\n/* 保持样例底色、字号、控件和读数样式；增加逐点解释。 */\n.panel{max-width:none;width:100%}h2{font-size:13px;margin:0}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:10.5px;margin:12px 0 6px;color:var(--ink-2)}.dot:before{content:\"\";display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:5px}.truth:before{background:#2f7d6b}.model:before{background:#b26a39}.base:before{background:#41699b}.mud{background:#f4f7eb;padding:0 4px}#porosity,#residual{margin-top:-1px;border-top-left-radius:0;border-top-right-radius:0}.inspect,details{margin-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.section-head span{font-family:monospace;color:var(--jade)}.point-control{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:10px 0;font-size:12px}.point-control input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--jade)}.point-values{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.point-values div{padding:8px;background:#fff}.point-values span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}.point-values b{font:11px ui-monospace,monospace}#point-explain{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}details{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-2)}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--jade);font-weight:600}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:11px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:5px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:15px}.actions button{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:12px inherit;color:var(--jade);cursor:pointer}.actions span{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:12px}.ctl{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px}.ctl label{min-width:100%}.readouts,.point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.section-head{display:block}}\n\n/* 与老师 welllog-layer 样例一致：标题说明右侧、参数条上方。 */\n.demo-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#f6f5ee}.demo-head>div{flex:1;min-width:220px}.demo-head .lead{margin-bottom:0}.kicker{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--jade)}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:9px 15px;border-radius:7px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.btn.primary{background:var(--jade);border-color:var(--jade);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.btn.primary:hover{background:#256554;border-color:#256554}.btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--clay);outline-offset:3px}\n\n/* v2.2: fill the portal's full content width; match the reference's header/body structure. */\nbody{padding:0;background:var(--paper)}\n.panel{width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff}\n.demo-head{margin:0;padding:14px 18px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0;background:#fcfbf8;gap:18px}\n.demo-head>div{min-width:220px;flex:1}.demo-head h1{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px}.demo-head .lead{max-width:86ch;font-size:11.8px;line-height:1.7}\n.demo-controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:14px 24px;padding:11px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f6f0}\n.demo-controls .ctl{flex:0 1 340px;margin:0;gap:12px;min-width:250px}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:135px;font-size:11.5px}.demo-controls .ctl input{min-width:90px;width:150px}\n.demo-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(320px,.9fr);align-items:start}\n.demo-charts{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.demo-results{min-width:0;padding:16px 18px 18px}.demo-charts .legend{margin:0 0 9px;gap:8px 12px}\n.demo-charts svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.demo-results .readouts{margin-top:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n.demo-results .ro{padding:10px 12px}.demo-results .ro b{font-size:14px}.demo-results .note{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.8}\n.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values div{padding:9px 10px}\n.demo-results .section-head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.demo-results .section-head h2{font-size:12.5px}.demo-results .actions{gap:8px}.demo-results .actions span{flex-basis:100%}\n.demo-results .actions button{font-family:inherit;font-size:12px}.demo-results details{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.demo-results table{table-layout:fixed}button,input{touch-action:manipulation}\n@media(max-width:960px){.demo-body{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.demo-charts{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.demo-results .readouts{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media(max-width:560px){body{padding:0}.panel{border-radius:9px}.demo-head,.demo-controls,.demo-charts,.demo-results{padding:12px}.demo-controls{gap:10px}.demo-controls .ctl{flex:1 1 100%;min-width:0;flex-wrap:nowrap}.demo-controls .ctl label{min-width:130px}.demo-results .readouts,.demo-results .point-values{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.demo-head h1{font-size:16px}.demo-head .btn{margin-left:auto}}\n\n.charts figure{margin:0 0 12px}.charts figcaption{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-2);margin-bottom:6px}.charts canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;cursor:crosshair}#metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--line)}#metrics div{background:white;padding:10px}#metrics span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-3)}#metrics strong{font:14px ui-monospace,monospace;color:var(--jade)}#details{overflow:auto}#details table{table-layout:auto;font-size:10px}.point-values b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.point-values div{min-width:0}#diagnostic{margin-top:10px}.coeff{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}","mime":"text/css"},{"name":"demo/demo.js","size":13566,"enc":"text","data":"(function(){const TYPE=\"tank\",SPEC={\"unit\":\"\",\"value\":6,\"inspect\":\"液位m，视觉只是数值传感代理且不参与报警。五分钟物料平衡会在事件边缘产生延迟和拖尾；零流失时无合成事件。异常也可能由计量或传感器问题造成。\",\"classes\":[\"详见图内单位与图例\"]};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id),clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));function rng(s){return()=>{s=(Math.imul(1664525,s)+1013904223)>>>0;return s/4294967296}}\nlet seed=91,rows=[],head=[],frame=0;\nfunction fit(data){let n=data[0].x.length,A=Array.from({length:n},()=>Array(n+1).fill(0));for(const {x,y} of data)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){for(let j=0;j<n;j++)A[i][j]+=x[i]*x[j];A[i][n]+=x[i]*y}for(let i=1;i<n;i++)A[i][i]+=.01;for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let p=i;for(let j=i+1;j<n;j++)if(Math.abs(A[j][i])>Math.abs(A[p][i]))p=j;[A[i],A[p]]=[A[p],A[i]];let v=A[i][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[i][j]/=v;for(let z=0;z<n;z++)if(z!==i){let q=A[z][i];for(let j=i;j<=n;j++)A[z][j]-=q*A[i][j]}}return A.map(row=>row[n])}\nconst predict=(w,x)=>w.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+v*x[i],0),mae=(a,b)=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-b[i]),0)/a.length;\nfunction chart(id,series,min,max,xlabel,ylabel,bands=[]){let c=$(id),g=c.getContext('2d'),w=640,h=340;g.clearRect(0,0,w,h);const px=i=>55+i/Math.max(1,series[0].values.length-1)*560,py=v=>285-(v-min)/(max-min)*240;\n bands.forEach(b=>{g.fillStyle=b.color;g.fillRect(px(b.start),45,px(b.end)-px(b.start),240)});\n g.font='12px sans-serif';g.lineWidth=1;for(let i=0;i<=4;i++){let v=min+(max-min)*i/4,y=py(v);g.strokeStyle='#dce5df';g.beginPath();g.moveTo(55,y);g.lineTo(615,y);g.stroke();g.fillStyle='#4b6259';g.fillText(v.toFixed(max-min<1?2:max<=3?1:0),4,y+4)}g.fillText(ylabel,55,22);g.fillText(xlabel,215,333);for(let i=0;i<=4;i++)g.fillText(Math.round(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4),px(i*(series[0].values.length-1)/4)-5,306);\n series.forEach(s=>{g.strokeStyle=s.color;g.lineWidth=2;g.beginPath();s.values.forEach((v,i)=>{i?g.lineTo(px(i),py(v)):g.moveTo(px(i),py(v))});g.stroke()});}\nconst model=(()=>{let r=rng(17),d=[];for(let i=0;i<400;i++){let a=r(),b=r(),x,y;if(TYPE==='leak'){x=[1,a];y=.2+3*a+(r()-.5)*.5}else if(TYPE==='corrosion'){x=[1,a,b,a*b];y=.08+.25*a+.12*b+.08*a*b+(r()-.5)*.015}else if(TYPE==='pump'){let q1=a*90,q2=b*80;x=[1,q1,q2,q1*q1,q2*q2];y=2+.08*q1+.1*q2+.003*q1*q1+.004*q2*q2+(r()-.5)}else if(TYPE==='meter'){let actual=50+a*250,temp=b;let observed=actual*1.08+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*.5;x=[1,observed,temp];y=actual}else{x=[1,a];y=(r()-.5)*1.2}d.push({x,y})}let w=fit(d),res=d.map(v=>v.y-predict(w,v.x)),sd=Math.sqrt(res.reduce((s,v)=>s+v*v,0)/res.length);return {w,sd:Math.max(.2,sd)}})();\nfunction metrics(a){$('metrics').innerHTML=a.map(([a,b])=>'<div><span>'+a+'</span><strong>'+b+'</strong></div>').join('')}\nfunction counts(a,t){let tp=0,fp=0,fn=0;a.forEach((v,i)=>{if(v&&t[i])tp++;else if(v)fp++;else if(t[i])fn++});return {f:t.some(Boolean)?(200*tp/Math.max(1,2*tp+fp+fn)).toFixed(1)+'%':'—（无事件）',fp,fn}}\nfunction run(){let p=+$('param').value,n=+$('noise').value/100,r=rng(seed);$('pv').value=p;$('nv').value=n.toFixed(2);$('seed').textContent=seed;$('report').textContent='';rows=[];\nif(TYPE==='leak'){let raw=[],score=[],truth=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let change=.5+.4*Math.sin(i/13),event=i>=50&&i<90&&p>0,value=.2+3*change+(event?p:0)+(r()-.5)*n*4,residual=value-predict(model.w,[1,change]),z=residual/model.sd;raw.push(value);score.push(z);truth.push(event?1:0);alarm.push(z>3?1:0);base.push(value>2.5?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,truth);chart('a',[{values:raw,color:'#43836b'}],-2,15,'分钟采样序号','入口−出口流量差 / m³·h⁻¹');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-10,...score)*1.1,Math.max(55,...score)*1.1,'分钟采样序号（事件窗口50–89，零流失时无事件）','扣除管存代理后的残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['学习残差 F1',c.f],['固定流差阈值 F1',counts(base,truth).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['学习正常尺度',model.sd.toFixed(3)+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='400 条正常运行数据学习压力变化/管存代理与进出流差的关系，再对残差按正常尺度阈值检测。第一滑块为合成未解释流量，第二为传感噪声。异常流差也可能来自标定、时间不同步或模型误差，不能直接确认泄漏；未实现负压波定位或多相管存计算。';head=['minute','flow_imbalance_m3_h','residual_z','truth','alarm','fixed_threshold'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,raw[i],score[i],v,alarm[i],base[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='corrosion'){let trueRate=[],rate=[],depth=[],remaining=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let env=i/99,wet=.6,actual=.08+.25*env+.12*wet+.08*env*wet,x=clamp(env+(r()-.5)*n,0,1),est=Math.max(.01,predict(model.w,[1,x,wet,x*wet])),d=1.2+env*.8,year=(p-d)/est;trueRate.push(actual);rate.push(est);depth.push(d);remaining.push(Math.max(0,year));base.push(.25)}chart('a',[{values:trueRate,color:'#c59048'},{values:rate,color:'#43836b'},{values:base,color:'#648eae'}],0,.6,'缺陷编号（0–99）','腐蚀增长率 / mm·年⁻¹（合成）');chart('b',[{values:remaining,color:'#43836b'}],0,Math.max(45,...remaining)*1.05,'缺陷编号','达到教学损失阈值的外推时间 / 年');let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-trueRate[i]),0)/100;metrics([['模型增长率 MAE',mae(rate).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['固定速率 MAE',mae(base).toFixed(3)+' mm/年'],['损失阈值假设',p+' mm'],['最短外推时间',Math.min(...remaining).toFixed(1)+' 年']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成环境与润湿条件样本训练增长率回归；用当前损失量与预测增长率线性外推到指定损失阈值。第一滑块是教学阈值，第二是环境观测误差。未进行两次内检测缺陷配准或真实剩余强度评定，外推时间不是合规寿命、破裂时间或维修期限。';head=['defect','current_loss_mm','true_rate_mm_y','predicted_rate_mm_y','time_to_assumed_limit_y'];rows=rate.map((v,i)=>[i,depth[i],trueRate[i],v,remaining[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='pump'){let all=[];for(let q1=0;q1<=90;q1++){let q2=p-q1;if(q2<0||q2>80)continue;let power=pumpPower(q1,q2)*(1+n*.2);all.push({q1,q2,power})}let best=all.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.power-b.power)[0],equal=p/2,base=equal<=80?pumpPower(equal,equal)*(1+n*.2):null;chart('a',[{values:all.map(v=>v.power),color:'#43836b'}],0,150,'可行分配序号（第一泵流量递增）','预测总功率 / kW（合成）');chart('b',[{values:[best.q1,best.q2],color:'#43836b'},{values:[equal,equal],color:'#648eae'}],0,100,'泵编号 0 / 1','绿最优 / 蓝均分流量 m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['最优功率',best.power.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['均分基线',base===null?'容量不兼容':base.toFixed(2)+' kW'],['推荐分配',best.q1+' / '+best.q2+' m³/h'],['需求约束',best.q1+best.q2+' / '+p]]);$('explain').textContent='400 个合成运行点拟合两泵流量与总功率二次代理，在总流量等于需求、单泵不超过 90/80 m³/h 条件下枚举整数分配并最小化预测功率。第二滑块统一增加阻力代价，换井增加已知的分泵阻力修正，固定回归系数不变。仅为两泵分流，不是完整管网水力或压缩机优化；未校验扬程、汽蚀、最小流量或启停约束，零流量也保留模型常数项。';head=['pump0_m3_h','pump1_m3_h','predicted_power_kW','selected'];rows=all.map(v=>[v.q1,v.q2,v.power,v===best?1:0]);}\nif(TYPE==='meter'){let truth=[],raw=[],correct=[],temperature=[];for(let i=0;i<100;i++){let actual=80+i*2,temp=.5+.3*Math.sin(i/12),reading=actual*(1.08+p/100)+3+4*temp+(r()-.5)*n*10;truth.push(actual);raw.push(reading);correct.push(predict(model.w,[1,reading,temp]));temperature.push(temp)}let mae=a=>a.reduce((s,v,i)=>s+Math.abs(v-truth[i]),0)/100;chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:raw,color:'#648eae'},{values:correct,color:'#43836b'}],0,380,'独立测试点序号','流量 / m³·h⁻¹（统一参考条件）');chart('b',[{values:raw.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#648eae'},{values:correct.map((v,i)=>v-truth[i]),color:'#43836b'}],-20,100,'测试点序号','校正前后误差 / m³·h⁻¹');metrics([['校正 MAE',mae(correct).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['原始读数 MAE',mae(raw).toFixed(2)+' m³/h'],['学得读数系数',model.w[1].toFixed(4)],['测试新增增益漂移',p+'%']]);$('explain').textContent='400 个独立参考标定点学习“读数+温度代理→参考流量”的线性校正。第一滑块只改变标定后的测试增益漂移，第二增加测试读数噪声；固定校正会在漂移增加时失准，不能无条件沿用。不是多相流率反演或标准温压换算，不自动修改真实仪表系数。橙参考、蓝原读数、绿校正。';head=['sample','reference_m3_h','raw_m3_h','corrected_m3_h','temperature_proxy'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,raw[i],correct[i],temperature[i]]);}\nif(TYPE==='tank'){let level=4,truth=[],radar=[],vision=[],leaks=[],score=[],alarm=[],base=[];for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let event=i>=45&&i<90&&p>0;level+=(2-(event?p:0))/60/50;truth.push(level);radar.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.01);vision.push(level+(r()-.5)*n*.02);leaks.push(event?1:0)}for(let i=0;i<120;i++){let residual=i>=5?(radar[i-5]+2*5/60/50-radar[i])*50/(5/60):0,z=(residual-predict(model.w,[1,.5]))/model.sd;score.push(z);alarm.push(i>=5&&z>3?1:0);base.push(radar[i]<3.95?1:0)}let c=counts(alarm,leaks);chart('a',[{values:truth,color:'#c59048'},{values:radar,color:'#43836b'},{values:vision,color:'#648eae'}],3.7,4.2,'分钟序号（零流失时无事件）','橙真值 / 绿雷达 / 蓝视觉代理液位 m');chart('b',[{values:score,color:'#43836b'},{values:score.map(()=>3),color:'#c59048'}],Math.min(-15,...score)*1.1,Math.max(40,...score)*1.1,'分钟序号（5 分钟滑窗）','液位物料平衡残差 / 学习尺度');metrics([['残差检测 F1',c.f],['低液位基线 F1',counts(base,leaks).f],['误报 / 漏报',c.fp+' / '+c.fn],['合成未解释流失',p+' m³/h']]);$('explain').textContent='假设罐截面积 50 m²、净入流 2 m³/h，以五分钟雷达液位变化核对物料平衡，正常残差尺度从 400 点学习。蓝色视觉读数只是独立数值传感代理，当前不参与报警，未实现视频读数/OCR。第一滑块为未知流失量，第二为液位测量噪声；残差异常也可能来自传感故障或流量计误差，不能直接确认泄漏。滑窗使事件边缘出现延迟与拖尾。';head=['minute','true_level_m','radar_level_m','visual_proxy_level_m','truth_event','residual_score','alarm','low_level_alarm'];rows=truth.map((v,i)=>[i,v,radar[i],vision[i],leaks[i],score[i],alarm[i],base[i]]);}\n$('details').innerHTML='<table><tr>'+head.map(v=>'<th>'+v+'</th>').join('')+'</tr>'+rows.slice(0,5).map(row=>'<tr>'+row.map(v=>'<td>'+(typeof v==='number'?v.toFixed(3):v)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</table>';\n}\nfunction flush(){if(frame){cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0}run()}function schedule(){$('pv').value=$('param').value;$('nv').value=(+$('noise').value/100).toFixed(2);if(!frame)frame=requestAnimationFrame(()=>{frame=0;run()})}for(const id of ['param','noise']){$(id).oninput=schedule;$(id).onchange=flush}$('run').onclick=flush;$('new').onclick=()=>{seed+=13;flush()};$('csv').onclick=()=>{if(frame)flush();let q=v=>'\"'+String(v).replace(/\"/g,'\"\"')+'\"',b=new Blob(['\\ufeff'+[head,...rows].map(row=>row.map(q).join(',')).join('\\n')],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}),u=URL.createObjectURL(b),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='transport-'+TYPE+'-'+seed+'.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};\n\nlet selected=0;const rawRun=run;run=function(){rawRun();inspect();diagnostic();$('coeff').textContent='固定独立训练系数：'+JSON.stringify(model.w)+'；学习残差尺度 '+model.sd.toFixed(5)+(TYPE==='pump'?'；本井附加阻力修正等级 '+((seed-91)%11):'')};\nfunction inspect(){selected=Math.max(0,Math.min(rows.length-1,selected));$('point').max=rows.length-1;$('point').value=selected;$('position').textContent='序号 '+selected;let row=rows[selected];$('point-values').innerHTML=head.map((k,j)=>'<div><span>'+k+'</span><b>'+(typeof row[j]==='number'?row[j].toFixed(4):row[j])+'</b></div>').join('');$('point-explain').textContent=SPEC.inspect;}\nfunction diagnostic(){let a=rows.map(r=>TYPE==='leak'?+(r[3]!==r[4]):TYPE==='corrosion'?r[3]-r[2]:TYPE==='pump'?r[2]:TYPE==='meter'?r[3]-r[1]:+(r[4]!==r[6])),max=Math.max(.001,...a.map(Math.abs)),label=TYPE==='leak'||TYPE==='tank'?'逐分钟误报/漏报位置（高柱为判错）':TYPE==='corrosion'?'预测增长率−合成真值 / mm·年⁻¹':TYPE==='pump'?'满足同需求与容量约束的各候选功率 / kW':'校正后读数−参考值 / m³·h⁻¹';$('diagnostic').innerHTML='<text x=\"35\" y=\"16\" fill=\"#79828a\" font-size=\"11\">'+label+'</text><path d=\"M35 85H685\" stroke=\"#ded9cc\"/>'+a.map((v,i)=>'<rect x=\"'+(35+i/a.length*650)+'\" y=\"'+(v>=0?85-v/max*55:85)+'\" width=\"'+Math.max(.5,650/a.length-2)+'\" height=\"'+Math.max(.5,Math.abs(v)/max*55)+'\" fill=\"'+(v>=0?'#b26a39':'#41699b')+'\"/>').join('');}\n$('point').addEventListener('input',()=>{selected=+$('point').value;inspect()});$('a').addEventListener('click',ev=>{let r=$('a').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(ev.clientX-r.left)/r.width*640;selected=Math.round(Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(x-55)/560))*(rows.length-1));inspect()});$('reset').onclick=()=>{seed=91;$('param').value=SPEC.value;$('noise').value=20;selected=0;flush()};\n\nrun();\n\r\n\nfunction pumpPower(a,b){return predict(model.w,[1,a,b,a*a,b*b])+((seed-91)%11)*(.00025*a*a+.00008*b*b)}\n})();","mime":"text/javascript"}];c.tabs.demo={label:"可运行示范",mount(root){let h=CaseDemoHost.create(root,{files,demo},{scene:ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId],kase:c});return ()=>h.destroy()}};Cases.register(c);ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].demo=true;ATLAS.index.byId[c.sceneId].status="full";}